  "description": "Seo Jeong and Dong-Ha have been best friends since childhood. Seo Jeong, who was perfect in every way, from his looks to his grades, makes his acting debut after manifesting as a dominant Alpha, while Dong-Ha, a somewhat clumsy Beta, accepts Seo Jeong’s offer to work as his manager and moves in with him. Seo Jeong accidentally notices Dong-Ha’s inverted nipples and tries an outlandish “treatment,” but Dong-Ha, taken in by his seemingly plausible (?) explanation, allows Seo Jeong to treat his chest. At first, he didn’t feel anything, but as his senses gradually became more acute and he began to sense something was off, Dong-Ha, in a rare occurrence, manifests as a recessive Omega. Seo Jeong volunteers to be Dong-Ha’s treatment partner under the pretense of curing his unstable pheromones…\n\n *“Dong-Ha, I don’t think this treatment is working for you.”\n“…Yeah.”\n“Having sex with an Alpha. Let’s just do that pheromone therapy together.”*\n\nDong-Ha is mercilessly swept along by Seo Jeong, who charges at him like a bulldozer without ever tiring. Will Dong-Ha ever be able to live a peaceful life as an Omega?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
